      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We can confirm that we're definitely receiving quite a lot of incoming volume about Bitdefender causing some unexpected crashing issues when using video players or miscellaneous connection issues.\n\nIf you're experiencing this exact situation, you may want to consider contacting Bitdefender's Support Team directly at https://www.bitdefender.com/consumer/support/help/ to provide details that could aid them in identifying the root cause.",
